    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "cake.png",
          "language": "png",
          "contents": "",
          "folderId": "0",
          "url": "/level_starter_assets/ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-lesson7-level2c-test-2025/uuid/53c2bd8d-3a2e-4a26-8245-aa593f2eae03.png",
          "type": "starter",
          "active": false
        },
        "5": {
          "id": "5",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>Classic Wedding Cake Recipe</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <h1>Classic Three-Tier Wedding Cake</h1>\n    <p>An elegant vanilla cake with buttercream frosting</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <h2>Accessibility Controls</h2>\n    <button id=\"toggle-font-btn\">Increase Font Size</button>\n    <button id=\"toggle-details-btn\">Show Extra Details</button>\n    <button id=\"swap-image-btn\">Change Cake Image</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"recipe-content\">\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <h2>Ingredients</h2>\n      <p>For the cake layers:</p>\n      <div id=\"ingredients-details\">\n        <p>6 cups all-purpose flour</p>\n        <p>4 cups granulated sugar</p>\n        <p>2 cups unsalted butter, softened</p>\n        <p>12 large eggs</p>\n        <p>2 cups whole milk</p>\n        <p>4 tablespoons baking powder</p>\n        <p>2 tablespoons vanilla extract</p>\n        <p>1 teaspoon salt</p>\n      </div>\n      <p>For the buttercream frosting:</p>\n      <div id=\"frosting-details\">\n        <p>4 cups unsalted butter, softened</p>\n        <p>16 cups powdered sugar</p>\n        <p>1 cup heavy cream</p>\n        <p>4 tablespoons vanilla extract</p>\n        <p>Pinch of salt</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <h2>Step 1: Prepare Your Workspace</h2>\n      <p>Before you begin baking, make sure your kitchen is organized and \n      ready. Preheat your oven to 350 degrees Fahrenheit. Grease and flour \n      three round cake pans in different sizes: 12-inch, 9-inch, and 6-inch. \n      Line the bottoms with parchment paper for easy removal.</p>\n      <div id=\"prep-details\">\n        <p>Gather all your measuring cups and spoons. Set out your mixing \n        bowls. Make sure you have enough counter space to work. Check that \n        your butter is at room temperature. This step is crucial for proper \n        mixing and texture.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <h2>Step 2: Mix the Cake Batter</h2>\n      <p>In a large mixing bowl, cream together the softened butter and \n      sugar until light and fluffy. This should take about 5 minutes of \n      mixing. Add the eggs one at a time, beating well after each addition. \n      Mix in the vanilla extract.</p>\n      <div id=\"mixing-details\">\n        <p>In a separate bowl, whisk together the flour, baking powder, and \n        salt. Gradually add the dry ingredients to the butter mixture, \n        alternating with the milk. Begin and end with the flour mixture. \n        Mix until just combined. Do not overmix or your cake will be tough.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <h2>Step 3: Bake the Layers</h2>\n      <p>Divide the batter among your prepared pans. The largest pan should \n      get about half the batter, the medium pan gets about one-third, and \n      the smallest pan gets the remainder. Tap the pans gently on the \n      counter to remove air bubbles.</p>\n      <div id=\"baking-details\">\n        <p>Bake for 25-35 minutes, depending on pan size. The smallest layer \n        will bake fastest. Test for doneness by inserting a toothpick in the \n        center. It should come out clean. Let the cakes cool in the pans for \n        10 minutes, then turn out onto wire racks to cool completely.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <h2>Step 4: Make the Buttercream</h2>\n      <p>While your cakes are cooling, prepare the buttercream frosting. \n      Beat the softened butter in a large bowl until creamy and smooth. \n      Gradually add the powdered sugar, one cup at a time, beating well \n      after each addition.</p>\n      <div id=\"frosting-prep-details\">\n        <p>Add the heavy cream, vanilla extract, and salt. Beat on high \n        speed for 3-5 minutes until the frosting is light and fluffy. If \n        the frosting is too thick, add more cream one tablespoon at a time. \n        If too thin, add more powdered sugar.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <h2>Step 5: Assemble and Decorate</h2>\n      <p>Place the largest cake layer on your serving plate or cake board. \n      Spread a generous layer of buttercream on top. Stack the medium layer \n      on top and repeat. Finally, add the smallest layer. Apply a thin \n      crumb coat of frosting over the entire cake and refrigerate for 30 \n      minutes.</p>\n      <div id=\"assembly-details\">\n        <p>After chilling, apply the final layer of frosting. Use an offset \n        spatula to create smooth sides and top. You can pipe decorative \n        borders, add fresh flowers, or keep it simple and elegant. \n        Refrigerate until ready to serve. Remove from refrigerator 30 \n        minutes before serving for best flavor.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"image-section\">\n    <h2>Finished Cake</h2>\n    <img id=\"cake-img\" class=\"cake-img\" src=\"cake.png\" alt=\"\" />\n    <p>Your beautiful three-tier wedding cake is ready to impress!</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "6": {
          "id": "6",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "const toggleFontBtn = document.querySelector(\"#toggle-font-btn\");\nconst toggleDetailsBtn = document.querySelector(\"#toggle-details-btn\");\nconst swapImageBtn = document.querySelector(\"#swap-image-btn\");\nconst bodyElement = document.querySelector(\"body\");\nconst ingredientsDetails = document.querySelector(\"#ingredients-details\");\nconst frostingDetails = document.querySelector(\"#frosting-details\");\nconst prepDetails = document.querySelector(\"#prep-details\");\nconst mixingDetails = document.querySelector(\"#mixing-details\");\nconst bakingDetails = document.querySelector(\"#baking-details\");\nconst frostingPrepDetails = document.querySelector(\"#frosting-prep-details\");\nconst assemblyDetails = document.querySelector(\"#assembly-details\");\nconst cakeImg = document.querySelector(\"#cake-img\");\n\ntoggleFontBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n\n});\n\ntoggleDetailsBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n\n});\n\nswapImageBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n\n});\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "7": {
          "id": "7",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* BAD ACCESSIBILITY #2: Font Size - Extremely small 9px base font */\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 20px;\n  background: #f0f0f0;\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 9px;\n}\n\n.header {\n  background: #e0e0e0;\n  padding: 15px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  border-radius: 5px;\n}\n\n/* BAD ACCESSIBILITY #1: Contrast - Light gray text on light background */\n.header h1 {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: #c5c5c5;\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\n\n.header p {\n  margin: 5px 0 0 0;\n  color: #d0d0d0;\n  font-size: 8px;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  background: white;\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 5px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.controls h2 {\n  margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  color: #333;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.controls button {\n  margin: 5px;\n  padding: 8px 15px;\n  background: #6a9bd8;\n  color: white;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 10px;\n}\n\n.controls button:hover {\n  background: #5080c0;\n}\n\n.recipe-content {\n  background: white;\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 5px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.section {\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  padding-bottom: 15px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n}\n\n.section:last-child {\n  border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n.section h2 {\n  margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  color: #d5d5d5;\n  font-size: 11px;\n}\n\n.section p {\n  margin: 5px 0;\n  color: #c8c8c8;\n  font-size: 8px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n/* BAD ACCESSIBILITY #4: Show or Hide Information - Details hidden by default */\n.section > div {\n  background: #fafafa;\n  padding: 10px;\n  margin: 10px 0;\n  border-left: 3px solid #ddd;\n  border-radius: 3px;\n}\n\n.hidden {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.image-section {\n  background: white;\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 5px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.image-section h2 {\n  margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  color: #333;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.image-section p {\n  margin: 10px 0 0 0;\n  color: #666;\n  font-size: 9px;\n}\n\n/* BAD ACCESSIBILITY #3: Image Alternatives - Placeholder image without alt */\n.cake-img {\n  width: 200px;\n  height: 200px;\n  background: #e0e0e0;\n  border-radius: 5px;\n  margin: 10px 0;\n}\n\n.large-text body {\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\n\n.large-text .header h1 {\n  font-size: 32px;\n}\n\n.large-text .header p {\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.large-text .controls h2 {\n  font-size: 20px;\n}\n\n.large-text .controls button {\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.large-text .section h2 {\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n.large-text .section p {\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.large-text .image-section h2 {\n  font-size: 20px;\n}\n\n.large-text .image-section p {\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        }
      },
